sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser / Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Proxy as kube-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OAuth as OpenShift OAuth /<br/>OIDC Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>TLS optional
    participant Upstream as Upstream App<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Browser,Upstream: Flow 1: OIDC / OpenShift OAuth Browser Authentication

    Browser->>Route: GET /app<br/>No session cookie
    Route->>Proxy: Forward (TLS terminated)
    Proxy->>Proxy: Session chain: no valid session
    Proxy-->>Route: 302 Redirect to /oauth2/start
    Route-->>Browser: 302 → /oauth2/start

    Browser->>Route: GET /oauth2/start
    Route->>Proxy: Forward
    Proxy->>Proxy: Generate CSRF token + PKCE verifier
    Proxy-->>Route: 302 Redirect to IdP authorize URL
    Route-->>Browser: 302 → IdP

    Browser->>OAuth: GET /authorize<br/>client_id, redirect_uri, PKCE
    OAuth-->>Browser: Login form
    Browser->>OAuth: POST credentials
    OAuth-->>Browser: 302 → /oauth2/callback?code=xxx

    Browser->>Route: GET /oauth2/callback?code=xxx
    Route->>Proxy: Forward
    Proxy->>OAuth: POST /token<br/>Authorization code + PKCE verifier<br/>TLS 1.2+, Client credentials
    OAuth-->>Proxy: Access token + ID token
    Proxy->>Redis: Store session (if Redis enabled)
    Redis-->>Proxy: OK
    Proxy-->>Route: 302 → /app + Set-Cookie (session)
    Route-->>Browser: 302 + session cookie

    Browser->>Route: GET /app + Cookie
    Route->>Proxy: Forward
    Proxy->>Proxy: Session chain: valid cookie session
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with identity headers<br/>X-Forwarded-User, X-Forwarded-Email
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Browser: Response

    Note over Browser,Upstream: Flow 2: Kubernetes Service Account Token Authentication

    Browser->>Route: GET /api/resource<br/>Authorization: Bearer <SA token>
    Route->>Proxy: Forward
    Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview: authenticated=true, user info
    Proxy->>Upstream: Forward with identity headers
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Browser: Response

    Note over Browser,Upstream: Flow 3: Envoy ext_authz Check

    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    Envoy->>Proxy: GET /oauth2/auth<br/>Forwarded headers
    Proxy->>Proxy: Session chain: validate session
    Proxy-->>Envoy: 202 Accepted (authenticated)<br/>or 401/403 (denied)
